It is Tuesday evening.
I arrive at the gym at half past five.
I always train on Tuesday and on Thursday.
I work on the laptop every day.
That is why I exercise.
The gym is very full today.
Many people come here after work.
I go to the reception.
The employee is very friendly.
"Good evening," she says.
"Hello," I answer.
I go into the workout room.
Sometimes I run first.
But today I only train with weights.
The workout lasts one hour.
It is very exhausting.
I am a little tired afterwards.
I leave the gym at half past six.
Now I go home and rest.
